mitments.\n\nThe supernatural horror follows Park's Jang Tae-sang, a man who has risen from poverty to become a successful pawnshop owner. Tae-sang's life of relative luxury is threatened when the Korean courtesan of a Japanese general goes missing. The general demands our protagonist\u2014known as \"Mr. Omniscient\" in the"
